Hi,

I took a look and there appears to be an issue with your evidence file.  All of the intensities are < 1, which leads MSstatsTMT to filter out all of those PSMs, leading to an error.  I don't think having an intensity of < 1 makes sense for all PSMs.  Could you check with how you output your processing file (right now it seems you output the intensities to be on a normalized 0-1 scale).

Tony

